# Oversized media (>25MB Cloudflare Pages limit).
#
# These are NOT hosted anywhere yet. transcripts.iantopia.com answers every
# /media/* path with a 200 HTML fallback, so it looks like a working CDN to a
# status-code check while actually serving no bytes -- do not point at it
# without fetching the body and confirming the content-type first.
#
# Kept on disk so `astro dev` serves them locally; they will 404 in production
# until they are hosted for real.
